$ whycant exec /srv/bin

✗ alice (uid 1000) cannot exec /srv/bin

  /          drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ traverse
  /srv       drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ traverse
  /srv/bin   drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✗ is a directory   ← blocked here

Why
  /srv/bin is a directory, which cannot be run. To check entering it:
  whycant traverse /srv/bin
